OL,1,V7w3s7s35E                         G5/16
OL,2,V55555555CNUT: TEACHERS' ANGER
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CAT "4.5% PAY OFFER"
OL,5, NUT general secretary Fred Jarvis has
OL,6, warned of "deep anger and resentment"
OL,7, in schools if the Government imposes a
OL,8, 4.5% pay rise in England and Wales.
OL,10, He was speaking on the first day of
OL,11, their annual conference in Scarborough.
OL,13, Commenting on reports that the Govt was
OL,14, considering a 4.5% rise, he said: "If
OL,15, it's true, it is totally unacceptable."
OL,16, Teachers in Scotland are to get 6%.
OL,18, The conference heard a call from its
OL,19, new president Malcolm Horne for the
OL,20, profession to move towards one union
OL,21, for all teachers.
OL,23,F]DFrom 02-04-88 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
