OL,1,V7w3s7s35E                         G6/16
OL,2,V55555555C42 FANS HELD IN
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CHOLIDAY RESORT
OL,5, Forty-two football fans were arrested
OL,6, after a number of incidents in the
OL,7, centre of a holiday resort.
OL,9, The Scunthorpe fans had been staying
OL,10, overnight in Bridlington, North
OL,11, Humberside, planning to go on to a
OL,12, match in Scarborough.
OL,14, Bridlington police were helped by units
OL,15, of the Humberside force's support group
OL,16, to deal with several incidents of
OL,17, public disorder, damage and assault.
OL,19, Police said 39 of the fans were still
OL,20, being held in custody while inquiries
OL,21, continued.
OL,23,F]DFrom 02-04-88 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
