OL,1,V7w3s7s35B                         G7/16
OL,2,V55555555C14 KILLED IN THREE
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CHOLIDAY CRASHES
OL,5, Three young men died when their car
OL,6, went out of control and plunged into a
OL,7, sludge pit in a quarry at Shotts,
OL,8, Strathclyde.
OL,10, The three, Russell Nelson, 19, Alastair
OL,11, Russell, 20, and Walter Alexander, 18,
OL,12, all from Shotts, took the number of
OL,13, holiday deaths to 14 in three crashes.
OL,15, Adrian Thompson, his wife, two children
OL,16, and their grandmother died in a crash
OL,17, at Glenshane Pass, Co Londonderry,which
OL,18, also killed another driver,Paul Marr,17
OL,20, Five people died in a three-car pile-up
OL,21, at Farleton, Cumbria, near the M6.
OL,23,F]DFrom 02-04-88 / teletextarchive.com
