OL,2,V55555555CISRAELIS SHOOT DEAD
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CFOUR PALESTINIANS
OL,5, Israeli troops have shot dead four
OL,6, Palestinians in continuing violence in
OL,7, the West Bank and Gaza Strip.
OL,9, Three Palestinians were killed in one
OL,10, incident when troops opened fire on
OL,11, youths attacking them with sticks and
OL,12, stones, said an army spokesman.
OL,14, One Israeli soldier was stabbed in the
OL,15, clash and another was slightly hurt. In
OL,16, another incident, troops shot dead a
OL,17, Palestinian youth in Bethlehem.
OL,19, The latest deaths brought the toll in
OL,20, the 16 weeks of the anti-Israeli
OL,21, uprising to 127 Palestinians and one
OL,22, Israeli soldier.
OL,23,F]DFrom 02-04-88 / teletextarchive.com
